      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَسْلَطُ</span></b>  <i>More,</i> and <i>most, overcoming, prevailing,
predominating,</i> or <i>superior in power</i> or <i>force.</i>
(Har p. 661.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُوَ أَسْلَطُهُمْ لِسَانًا</span> <i>He is the most
